        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wu'sondo na milagi' hekeheke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'yombe na iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli u'v'awi'le ati', ‘Yi'li'mudima muv'e v'asondo, ku'nguno ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, ni' musondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ki'la muntu' mugati' na inywe yi'li'mudima amuku'zye ise na nnina, na yi'li'mudima ku'zidima nsiku' zya ki'suuho i'zyo zili' Sabato zyanne. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' mugalu'ke ku'vilonda vimbulimbuli, ninga ku'du' mwiv'ezezye milungu zya ku'sula. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ali'vi aho mulav'e muli'nfumi'zya ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha kwiswanania, mulafumye ku' nzi'la i'yo yi'li'koov'iwa ki'gele ki'zumiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'taambo cheni'cho yi'li'koov'iwa ki'liwe lu'siku' lwene lu'lo u'lo mulav'e mwaki'si'nzaga ninga lu'siku' lwa wu'v'i'li'. Ali'vi ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo cha ki'taambo cheni'cho i'cho ki'lasigali'le mpaka lu'siku' lwa wu'datu' yi'lamudime muki'zigye mu moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' ki'taambo cheni'cho kize ki'liwe ninga hadoo ku' lu'siku' lwa wu'datu', ki'lav'e zoma, nacho ki'kasye ki'zumiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawe u'yo alalye nyama yeni'yo alawu'sombe wu'kenagu'zi wakwe, ku'nguno alav'e waki'yagazya ki'ntu' ki'sondo chamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Aho mulav'e muli'wi'mbu'la viliwa ku'fuma ku' nsi' yinywe, ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'wi'mbu'la mpaka ku' lu'v'i'mbi', ninga ku'du' mwize musu'v'e ku'salala nsalazyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'su'v'a ku'kuminga nsalazyo ya mizabibu zinywe, ninga ku'solela nzabibu i'zyo zigwile ha nsi'. Mulazilekele ku'nguno ya v'api'na na v'ageni v'izi'li'zi. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' wiv'e, ku'du' u'yombe wu'fi, ninga ku'du' muv'e muli'wikonga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'lahi'le ku' wu'fi ku' ku'tu'mi'la lina lyanne, na ku'li'yagazya lina lyamwa Mulungu wako. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'mwiwonelezye mwiyo ninga ku'mupuzya nsawo yakwe. Wu'tenensya wa musyala wako ku'du' wikale ku' wako wu'ziku'pee mpaka ndiyu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'mutyomokele nkiv'a, ninga ku'pi'ngani'ka ki'ntu' ha mbele ya muhofu, ali'vi yi'li'ku'dima u'mogohe Mulungu wako. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
