        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Yi'li'ku'dima u'zidime nhama zyanne. Ku'du' wize u'zileke mitugo zyako ziliinwe na mitugo zya mukoli gu'ngi'. Ku'du' wize u'hambe mbiyu' zya mikoli iv'i'li' mu mugu'nda gwako. Ku'du' wize u'v'e u'li'zwala ki'zwalo i'cho ki'sumilwe ku' mikoli iv'i'li' zya wu'zi hekeheke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Hangi' u'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo alale na muki'ma muzya u'yo akwiv'ilwe na mugosya yu'ngi', nawe akakomolilwe ku' ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo, ninga ku'leku'li'lwa iyagalu'le, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo afumiwe masumule. Ali'vi ku'du' v'awu'lagwe ku'nguno muki'ma mwenu'yo wali' akaali' ku'leku'li'lwa iyagalu'le. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugosya mwenu'yo yi'lamudime alete ng'ondi ayi'fumye ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya yi'v'e ki'taambo cha masumule gakwe cha ku'sini'zya musango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano ku'v'i'ti'la ku' ng'ondi yeni'yo ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi u'wo wawu'v'ezizye, nawe alatondolwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Aho mulav'e mwingi'la ku' nsi' i'yo ya Kanaani na ku'hamba mikoli hekeheke zya miti' zya visumo, mulaviv'azye visumo vyazyo ku'v'a vigiziv'ilwe. Ku' itungo lya myaka idatu' miti' zyeni'zyo zilav'e ki'ti' igizyo na visumo vyazyo vikasye viliwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' mwaka gwa wu'ne visumo vyazyo vyose vilav'e visondo, ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo ka lu'kumo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa mwaka gwa wu'tano mukowolile ku'lya visumo vyazyo. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' lyi'mbu'la linywe li'lingi'he. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' mwize mulye nyama ninga yi'mo ya wu'su'lu'le magazi. Ku'du' mwize muv'ezye wu'lagu'zi ninga wu'fumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' musenye nyele mu mpelo na mitwe, ninga ku'senya ndezu mu mpelo mpelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninga ku'du' mwisalange mu miv'i'li' zinywe, ninga kwiola mu miv'i'li' zinywe ku'nguno ya v'afwile. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'muyagazye mwaniki' wako ku' ku'muv'ezya mulav'a, ki'gele nsi' ku'du' yize yi'galu'ki'le ku' wu'lav'a na kokala wu'kenagu'zi wu'hanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Yi'li'mudima muzidime nsiku' zya ki'suuho na ku'haku'zya hantu' hasondo ha wanne. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' muv'ayi'le v'a mizimu, ninga ku'v'alonda v'alagu'zi, ki'gele v'akamulagu'le, ku'nguno v'alamuv'ezezye zoma. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' munamala wa nvwi' av'e ha mbele yako yi'li'ku'dima wi'me ki'gele u'mupe iku'zyo lyakwe, nanho u'mogohe Mulungu wako. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' mugeni mwizi'li'zi ikale haki'mo nanho mu nsi' yako, ku'du' u'muv'ezezye mav'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugeni u'yo ikalile haki'mo nanho av'e ki'ti' muv'yalwa wa ku' winywe, na u'mutogwe ki'ti' i'vi witogilwe ev'e mweni'ki'li', ku'nguno na inywe mwav'age muli' v'ageni ku' nsi' ya Misili. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'tu'mi'le vipimo vya wu'yengani aho u'li'pima wu'lihu, wu'timbu ninga wingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'li'ku'dima u'tu'mi'le mizani zya lole na ngelo zya lole",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19:36",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ku' Ki'ebulania, “mizani zya lole, mawe ga lole, efa ya lole na hini ya lole.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, u'yo namufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
